<newsitem itemid="101973" id="root" date="1996-10-08" xml:lang="en">
<title>UK: Merrill Lynch restructures UK equity trading.</title>
<headline>Merrill Lynch restructures UK equity trading.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Securities firm Merrill Lynch &amp; Co will restructure its UK equity trading desk, reducing the 64-strong operation to 50, the company said in a statement on Tuesday.</p>
</text>
